# CODEOWNERS — money-path ownership for skr-crypto.
#
# Each pattern below requires the listed reviewer to approve a PR that
# modifies any matching file. Branch protection on `main` enforces this.
#
# While the project has a single committer, the rule operates as a
# self-discipline gate (24-hour cooling-off period before self-approval —
# see CONTRIBUTING.md). When a second committer joins, it becomes a
# real two-eyes check.
#
# Rationale: docs/adr/0007-engineering-safety-practices.md
# Pattern reference: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

